<P STYLE="font: 14pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>XWELL Announces
Definitive Agreement to Divest XpresSpa and XpresTest Businesses</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 14pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal"><I>Transformative
                                            transaction intended to maximize stockholder value</I></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal"><I>Repositions
                                            the Company to pursue a new strategic direction in the national security sector </I></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.25in"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Symbol; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal">&middot;</FONT></TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: normal"><I>Strengthens
                                            the Company&rsquo;s ability to deploy capital toward growth initiatives</I></FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>NEW YORK, DATE
(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)</B> -- XWELL, Inc. (Nasdaq: XWEL) (&ldquo;XWELL&rdquo; or the &ldquo;Company&rdquo;), a provider of wellness and biosecurity
solutions, and <FONT STYLE="background-color: #EEEEEE">&nbsp;</FONT>Face Haus, LLC (&ldquo;Face Haus&rdquo;), a leading skincare service
and product business, today announced that the Company has entered into a definitive agreement with an affiliate of Face Haus, Express
Wellness Group, LLC, under which XWELL will divest its XpresSpa Holdings, LLC and XpresTest, Inc. businesses for $13 million, subject
to certain closing adjustments.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The divestiture
is intended to maximize value for XWELL&rsquo;s stockholders and help facilitate a transformative strategic restructuring of XWELL. As
the Company seeks to pursue a new direction in the national security sector, proceeds from the divestiture are expected to strengthen
the Company&rsquo;s ability to deploy capital toward growth initiatives and support the Company&rsquo;s long-term success.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">XWELL&rsquo;s health
and wellness operations at retail locations outside of airports are not included in the divestiture. In conjunction with the transaction,
XWELL will continue its efforts to streamline operations, reduce operating expenses, and allocate capital toward initiatives aligned
with its evolving business strategy.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Bruce Bernstein,
Chairman of the Board of the Company, stated, &ldquo;This transaction represents an important milestone in the Company&rsquo;s strategic
evolution. By simplifying our portfolio and strengthening our balance sheet, we believe XWELL will be better positioned to pivot and
pursue opportunities in the national security sector while maintaining financial discipline and creating long-term value for our stockholders.&rdquo;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">The transaction,
which is expected to close later in 2026, is subject to XWELL stockholder approval and the satisfaction of other closing conditions.</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212121"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt"><B>About
XWELL, Inc.&#8239;&#8239;&nbsp;</B></FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212121"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">XWELL,
Inc. (Nasdaq: XWEL) is a global wellness company on a mission to liberate science-proven wellness for all. Through a portfolio of brands
that include XpresSpa&reg;, Naples Wax Center&reg;, and XpresCheck&reg;, XWELL delivers accessible, real-world wellness across travel,
retail, and clinical settings. For more information on XWELL&rsquo;s offerings, visit <U>www.XWELL.com</U>.&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

