<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212121"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white; color: #212121"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">This
communication is being made in connection with the proposed transaction. In connection with the proposed transaction, the Company intends
to file relevant materials with the Securities and Exchange Commission (the &ldquo;SEC&rdquo;), including a proxy statement. This communication
is not a substitute for the proxy statement or any other document that the Company may file with the SEC. STOCKHOLDERS ARE URGED TO READ
THE PROXY STATEMENT AND ALL OTHER RELEVANT DOCUMENTS FILED WITH THE SEC CAREFULLY AND IN THEIR ENTIRETY WHEN THEY BECOME AVAILABLE BECAUSE
THEY WILL CONTAIN IMPORTANT INFORMATION ABOUT THE PROPOSED TRANSACTION. Stockholders will be able to obtain the proxy statement and other
documents (when available) free of charge at the SEC&rsquo;s website, www.sec.gov, or free of charge from the Company at www.XWELL.com</FONT></P>

